                <Param name="text" val="Welcome! In this experiment, when you see the GO stimulus, press the SPACEBAR as quickly and accurately as possible. When you see the NO-GO stimulus, do not press any key. Remember:&#10;&#10;'X' is your GO stimulus = Press SPACEBAR&#10;'O' is NOGO stimulus = DO NOT press&#10;&#10;You will now complete a short practice round. Try to respond as accurately as possible. Try to respond accurately and remain focused throughout the experiment.&#10;&#10;Press SPACEBAR to begin." valType="str" updates="constant" plugin="None"/>
